q: title: 1H Spread: Knicks (-5.5), description: In the first half of the NBA game between Pelicans and Knicks, scheduled for March 24 at 7:30 PM ET:

This market will resolve to "Knicks" if the Knicks are winning by 6 or more points at halftime.

Otherwise, this market will resolve to "Pelicans".

The result will be determined based on the score at halftime only.

If the game is postponed, this market will remain open until the game has been completed. If the game is canceled entirely, with no make-up game, this market will resolve 50-50. market_id: 1698361 res_data: p1: 0, p2: 1, p3: 0.5. Where p1 corresponds to Pelicans, p2 to Knicks, p3 to unknown/50-50. Updates made by the question creator via the bulletin board at 0x65070BE91477460D8A7AeEb94ef92fe056C2f2A7 as described by https://polygonscan.com/tx/0xa14f01b115c4913624fc3f508f960f4dea252758e73c28f5f07f8e19d7bca066 should be considered.,initializer:91430cad2d3975766499717fa0d66a78d814e5c5,ooRequester:65070be91477460d8a7aeeb94ef92fe056c2f2a7